                <pb facs="0463" n="369" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg369"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the Greater Republic of Central
                            America</hi></placeName>[, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1896-12-07T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1896-11-29T00:00:00-05:00"
                    >undated</date>].</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President of the United States of America, in recognizing the Greater
                    Republic of Central America, constituted conformably to the stipulations of the
                    treaty of Amapala, of June 20, 1895, between the Republics of Honduras,
                    Nicaragua, and Salvador, and in entering upon diplomatic relations therewith,
                    gives such recognition and enters upon such relations upon the distinct
                    understanding that the responsibility of each of these Republics toward the
                    United States of America remains wholly unaffected.</p>
            </div>
